---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import GalleryPage from "../components/GalleryPage.jsx";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Generative Art Collection | Jonathan R Reed"
  description="Browse saved generative artworks from the Algorithmic Art Gallery by Jonathan R Reed, featuring space-filling curves and mathematical patterns."
>
  <div class="gallery-container">
    <h1 class="gallery-header">Gallery</h1>
    <p class="mono-text">
      By Jonathan R Reed. Updated <time datetime="2026-04-21">April 21, 2026</time>.
    </p>
    <p class="gallery-intro">
      Saved pieces collect the strongest algorithmic art runs from the generator.
      Use the gallery to revisit deterministic outputs, compare visual systems,
      and inspect how seed, symmetry, curve and color choices change each result.
    </p>
    <p class="gallery-intro">
      Each piece is treated as a reproducible study. The gallery gives finished
      outputs a place away from the live controls so visual decisions can be
      reviewed by composition, color balance, density, and pattern behavior.
    </p>
    <p class="gallery-links">
      <a href="/">Open generator</a>
      <a href="/about/">Read process notes</a>
    </p>
    <GalleryPage client:load />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
